@chrrxs/robloxstudio-mcp

This package distributes studio-plugin/MCPPlugin.rbxmx, a Roblox Studio plugin
that bundles a compiled copy of a third-party story renderer licensed under the
GNU General Public License version 3. The package as a whole is therefore
distributed under GPL-3.0-only; the full license text is in LICENSE.

Story renderer (vendor/ui-renderer)
  UI Labs, Copyright (c) PepeElToro41 and UI Labs contributors
  https://github.com/PepeElToro41/ui-labs
  License: GPL-3.0
  The pinned upstream commit is recorded in BUILDING.txt and
  mcp/vendor/ui-renderer/UPSTREAM_COMMIT inside the source archive.
  Only the renderer modules are bundled; the upstream toolbar plugin script is
  not included.

MCP preview adapter and renderer overlay
  studio-plugin/ui-renderer/ (adapter sources and upstream.patch) in the MCP
  repository are derivative of the story renderer and licensed under GPL-3.0.

Roblox Studio MCP server and plugin
  Copyright (c) 2025 (see LICENSE-MIT)
