Corresponding source
  studio-plugin/MCPPlugin-source.tar.gz contains the complete corresponding
  source for MCPPlugin.rbxmx: the MCP plugin source and build scripts, the
  pinned renderer source, patches, configs and pnpm lockfile, the MCP preview
  adapter, the sources, manifests and licenses of bundled Luau packages, and
  rebuild instructions (BUILDING.txt).
